WEBVTT

00:05:28.797 --> 00:05:31.392
people think that
those instruments are legitimate.

00:05:31.416 --> 00:05:34.386
So you get school boards
sending out letters like this:

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.870
"Dear Parent,

00:05:35.894 --> 00:05:40.044
because your kid owes
lunch money to the cafeteria,

00:05:40.068 --> 00:05:42.596
the result may be that your child
will be taken away

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.331
and put in foster care."

00:05:44.355 --> 00:05:46.131
This is going out from school boards

00:05:46.155 --> 00:05:47.322
because people think,

00:05:47.346 --> 00:05:50.880
"Well, that seems to be
an instrument of deterrence."

00:05:53.219 --> 00:05:55.139
When you board an airplane,

00:05:56.147 --> 00:05:59.273
before kids, before first class,